{"id":"165874db46d8b664","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-sequent.md","title":"矢列","display":"df-sequent — 矢列","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-sequent","aliases":["29-df-sequent"],"display":"df-sequent — 矢列","depends_on":["[[29-df-structure]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_locator":"Local proof-system interface; contrast Theorem1.34 p.21 scan36"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-sequent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-sequent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequent — 矢列"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Local proof-system interface; contrast Theorem1.34 p.21 scan36"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-sequent-—-矢列-$\\Gamma-\\Rightarrow-\\Delta$\">df-sequent — 矢列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma \\Rightarrow \\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma \\Rightarrow \\Delta\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为有限词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span> 与满足关系见所列依赖。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\)</span> 为有限公式集；本条先将矢列作为语法有序对构造，再分别给出一般及有限模型有效性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\mid\\operatorname{card}(X)&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\coloneqq\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\mid\\operatorname{card}(X)&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\coloneqq\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)^2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_S(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\\bigl((\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;A\\models\\gamma[\\beta])\\to\\exists\\delta\\in\\Delta\\;A\\models\\delta[\\beta]\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_S(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\\bigl((\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;A\\models\\gamma[\\beta])\\to\\exists\\delta\\in\\Delta\\;A\\models\\delta[\\beta]\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FinValidSeq}_S(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\\bigl((\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;A\\models\\gamma[\\beta])\\to\\exists\\delta\\in\\Delta\\;A\\models\\delta[\\beta]\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FinValidSeq}_S(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\\bigl((\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;A\\models\\gamma[\\beta])\\to\\exists\\delta\\in\\Delta\\;A\\models\\delta[\\beta]\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地矢列接口重构，供通用证明演算参数使用；原书Theorem1.34并未选择一个具名SC规则集。旧稿把语法矢列直接定义成有限模型有效性，随后又把它当成证明结论对象，混淆语法与语义。本条不给未指定SC赋予完备性；空后件代表不存在满足前件的赋值。有限与任意模型有效性显式分开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-sequent-—-矢列-$\\Gamma-\\Rightarrow-\\Delta$","text":"df-sequent — 矢列 $\\Gamma \\Rightarrow \\Delta$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · dep